{
  "tool_name": "group_aggregate",
  "version": "0.1",
  "purpose": "按一个或多个分组键对某张 data_view 表（源表或派生表）聚合，生成一张新的 group 派生表并登记到 data_view，只向模型返回句柄和受 budget 限制的样例组。",
  "tool_call": {
    "tool": "group_aggregate",
    "arguments": {
      "table_name": "orders",
      "search_scope": "full_table",
      "group_by": ["orders.product_id"],
      "aggregations": [
        {"op": "sum", "column": "orders.purchase_count", "as": "sum_purchase_count"},
        {"op": "count", "as": "row_count"}
      ]
    }
  },
  "tool_output": {
    "created_table": {
      "table_name": "g_orders_by_product",
      "kind": "group",
      "intent": "orders 按 product_id 分组，求 purchase_count 之和与行数",
      "columns": [
        {"name": "product_id", "semantic_type": "identifier"},
        {"name": "sum_purchase_count", "semantic_type": "numeric"},
        {"name": "row_count", "semantic_type": "numeric"}
      ],
      "num_rows": 2,
      "definition_in_harness": true
    },
    "group_sample_policy": {
      "type": "fixed_head",
      "num_rows": 2,
      "groups_total": 2,
      "truncated": false
    },
    "group_sample": [
      {"_gid": 0, "product_id": "P007", "sum_purchase_count": 10, "row_count": 6},
      {"_gid": 1, "product_id": "P012", "sum_purchase_count": 2, "row_count": 1}
    ]
  },
  "state_delta": {
    "data_view_changed": true,
    "added_table": "g_orders_by_product",
    "dynamic_table_context_changed": false,
    "static_task_memory_changed": false
  },
  "notes": [
    "group_aggregate 产出的是一张 data_view 派生表（kind=group），不直接进入 dynamic_table_context。",
    "完整分组结果可能很大，只向模型返回句柄和固定数量的样例组；模型要读具体组需对该表再调 retrieve_row_context。",
    "支持的聚合 op 为 sum、count、mean、min、max；除 count 外都要求可解析的数值列。",
    "group_by=[] 时退化为对整表的单组聚合，等价于 retrieve_row_context 自动返回的 matched_set_statistics。",
    "派生表的 definition 由 harness 保存用于按需重物化，不进入模型 prompt。",
    "每个分组行的成员原始行 id 只记录在 internal tool history，用于 reward，不在模型可见输出中展开。"
  ]
}
